title: DVP Rally
new-page: true

= DVP's Turn

@rally
title: Rally
view-if: dvp_rally_timer <= 0 and not (labor_minister_party == "DVP" and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0)

The DVP will hold a rally

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_reagan
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@class_collaboration
title: The class collaboration of the proletariat with the bourgeoisie.
view-if: workers_schleicher_bonus

The DVP's mesage of class collaboration appeals to all but the class conscious. [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0 : Schleicher's united labor front  ?] [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 1 : and popularity  ?] [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0 : has opposition to corporatism tantamount to support for revolution in the eyes of many. ?]

@rally_reagan
title: Wirtschaftsliberalismus - The reduction of taxation and government spending
view-if: upper_tax_rates > 1 and (dvp_leader == "zu Dohna-Schlodien" or dvp_leader == "Luther")

The DVP's speakers call for the reduction of taxation and government spending

[? if upper_tax_rates > 1: Recent bourgeoisie media commentary on the current tax structure have supplied ample fodder for their rhetoric ?]

@rally_nationalism
title: Supporting rearmament, nationalism, and an end to reparations
view-if: dvp_leader == "Scholz" or dvp_leader == "Dingeldey" or dvp_leader == "Hugo"

The DVP's speakers praise the military establishment and call for rearmament.

[? if dvp_nationalism >= 3 : With nationalism increasingly popular within their party, the rally's speakers call for the cessation of reparations and reuinifaction of Germany ?]

@rally_democracy
title: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascism</span>.
view-if: dvp_leader == "Stresemann" or dvp_leader == "Kardorff" or dvp_leader == "Curtius" or (upper_tax_rates <= 1 and (dvp_leader == "zu Dohna-Schlodien" or dvp_leader == "Luther"))

The DVP will defend the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> system and rail against the <span style="color: #808080;">monarchists</span> and <span style="color: #A00500;">communists</span> who threaten it.

[? if dvp_democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the middle classes and rural folk as much as more practical issues. ?]
[? if dvp_democratization >= 3 : Since they have consistently made democratization a theme of their campaigns, the middle classes and rural folk are enthusiastic about their message. ?]

@rally_lautenbach
title: Support the Lautenbach plan!
view-if: return_to_normalcy == 0 and dvp_lautenbach_adopted and (dvp_leader == "Thiel" or dvp_leader == "Glatzel") and not return_to_normalcy and (lautenbach_adopted <= dvp_lautenbach_rally or not dvp_in_government)

The Lautenbach plan has become a popular rallying cry for the DVP. The workers and employers see it as a necessary compromise. [? if not lautenbach_adopted: However, many are still skeptical whether the plan will actually prove effective. ?]

@rally_local
title: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
view-if: (dvp_leader == "Thiel" or dvp_leader == "Glatzel") and (return_to_normalcy or not dvp_lautenbach_adopted or not (lautenbach_adopted <= dvp_lautenbach_rally or not dvp_in_government))

The DVP's speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect workers, employers, and women in this moment.

@sa_disrupt
title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the DVP rally!
view-if: sa_force > 25 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the DVP rally!


- @rally_police
- @rally_cancel

@rally_police
title: The DVP has called the police to protect their rally
view-if: dvp_ideology == "Left"

The DVP have called the police to protect their rally

go-to: rally_police_win if police_protect_success_dvp >= 0; rally_police_lose if police_protect_success_dvp < 0

@rally_cancel
view-if: dvp_ideology != "Left"
title: The DVP have canceled their rally

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> have won this show of strength.

@rally_police_win
title: The police have prevailed!

The police successfully protected the DVP's rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_reagan
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@rally_police_lose
title: The police were unable or unwilling to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> mob.

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> have won this show of strength.
